  "behavior": [
    "Only descendants observed through native OPEN operations are considered for automatic startup; child requests use explicit native procedure IDs.",
    "Notification observation performs no nested IPC. Child startup is serviced between exchanges, after native PAUSED, once per observed child instance.",
